### 1. Criar aluno (Profile)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/profiles
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Maria",
  "email": "maria@email.com"
}

### 2. Criar categoria (Technology)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/technologies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Porcentagem"
}

### 3. Criar pergunta/quiz (Project)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Quiz de Porcentagem",
  "question": "Quanto é 25% de 200? A) 25 B) 40 C) 50 D) 75",
  "correctAnswer": "C",
  "profileId": 1,
  "technologyIds": [1]
}

### 4. Registrar resposta do aluno (Feedback)
POST http://localhost:8080/feedbacks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "projectId": 1,
  "studentAnswer": "C"
}

### 5. Listar alunos
GET http://localhost:8080/profiles

### 6. Listar categorias
GET http://localhost:8080/technologies

### 7. Listar quizzes
GET http://localhost:8080/projects

### 8. Listar resultados
GET http://localhost:8080/feedbacks
